   "parameters": {
    "content": "## HL · Unsubscribes everywhere (Lesson 5.6)\nBrevo webhook (unsubscribed, hard bounce, spam complaint) -> mark the person in Supabase the same day, so no other channel (WhatsApp, SMS, outreach) markets to them either. Every channel checks marketing_consent.status before marketing.\n\nIn Brevo: Transactional/Marketing webhooks -> URL https://YOUR_N8N_DOMAIN/webhook/hl-brevo-events?token=YOUR_WEBHOOK_SECRET, events unsubscribed, hard bounce, spam.\nMailchimp has the same webhooks.\n\nCredentials: Postgres (Supabase).\nPlaceholders: YOUR_WEBHOOK_SECRET.",
    "height": 320,
    "width": 500
   },
